            <div xml:id="d494">

                <pb facs="0541" n="443" sameAs="frus:frus1930v02/pg443"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/359</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State of a Conversation
                        With the Chinese Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">C. C.
                    Wu</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-05-15">May 15, 1930</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Minister Wu called to renew relations. He said he had been talking over certain
                    particular matters with Dr. Hornbeck, and had discussed extraterritoriality with
                    him in a tentative way during my absence. He wanted to know whether he should
                    continue. I said to go ahead and Dr. Hornbeck would take it up with me.</p>
                <closer><signed>H[<hi rendition="#small-caps">enry</hi>] L. S[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">timson</hi>]</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
